{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And you shall take.</b> This fat mentioned is that which is on the intestines, as written in the portion of Leviticus." "<b>Thigh.</b> The right side. The breast is taken from the ram of ordination, and the thigh and the breast shall from this day be given to Aaron and to his sons from the peace offerings of the children of Israel; only the breast of the ram of ordination Moses alone shall eat, for he is the priest of priests."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:06.931330825Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}